#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/contributing.rst:2
msgid "Contributing to cc3"
msgstr "Contribuir a cc3"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/contributing.rst:4
msgid ""
"We encourage people to contribute their projects, libraries, bugfixes, and "
"enhancements."
msgstr ""
"Animamos a la gente a contribuir con sus proyectos, bibliotecas, "
"correcciones de errores y mejoras."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/contributing.rst:8
msgid "Bugfixes"
msgstr "Correcciones de errores"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/contributing.rst:10
msgid ""
"The best way to contribute bugfixes are through the ticket system. Patches "
"are welcome."
msgstr ""
"La mejor manera de contribuir con correcciones de errores es a través del "
"sistema de tickets. Los parches son bienvenidos."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/contributing.rst:14
msgid "Wiki"
msgstr "Wiki"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/contributing.rst:16
msgid ""
"We are investigating having personal pages on the wiki for contributed code "
"and ideas."
msgstr ""
"Estamos investigando tener páginas personales en el wiki para código e ideas"
" aportados."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/contributing.rst:20
msgid "Discussion"
msgstr "Debate"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/contributing.rst:22
msgid ""
"The discussion board is open for posting. Consider posting ideas or code!"
msgstr ""
"El tablón de debate está abierto para publicar. ¡Considere publicar ideas o "
"código!"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/contributing.rst:25
msgid "SVN Access"
msgstr "Acceso SVN"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/contributing.rst:27
msgid ""
"We are also investigating giving out commit access to parts of the version "
"control repository. This way, interested people can directly contribute code"
" to the project."
msgstr ""
"También estamos investigando dar acceso de commit a partes del repositorio "
"de control de versiones. De esta manera, las personas interesadas pueden "
"contribuir código directamente al proyecto."
